inl note_of_ci_after_spi_migration_26 () = Note ("CI-AFTER-SPI-MIGRATION", 26u32, "2026-10-19T18:06Z", "main-thread", "2026-10-19 14:06 main lap 4: closed. The goal (first CI runs after the 10-12 .spi migration build lib from .spi with a same-commit compiler) is met in all four repos by green gh-pages workflow runs: spiral 39127751148 / 39137454207 / 39140706896 (tibia-lane evidence 10-18), dice 39137457442 10-18 14:45, alphabet 39137471864 10-18 14:46, polyglot 39137464267 10-18 14:46. Today's 06:48 reds are new causes (rustix on nightly, dir-tree-html UTF-8, eoie partial commit) owned by PIPELINES-GREEN and RUST-NIGHTLY-EVERYWHERE.")
inl note_of_notebooks_to_spi_siblings_1 () = Note ("NOTEBOOKS-TO-SPI-SIBLINGS", 1u32, "2026-10-14T12:55Z", "lane-b", "design (Perf/Tasks): Tasks' run cells already assert (///! gleam,fsharp,cuda,rust,typescript,python + _assert sm'.contains), so each maps 1:1 to a test block with ///> lines (///! -> ///>), no output-only tests needed; Perf has 0 spiral fences (5 Kino smart cells + 13 F#): migrate its 5 smart cells as tests whose stdout lands in the .spi.ipynb report, keep the F# cells as an F# notebook")
