inl note_of_pack_next_4_17 () = Note ("PACK-NEXT-4", 17u32, "2026-10-23T05:09Z", "main", "2026-10-23 01:09 run-time census of the next3b reference run (single-flight-20261022-184215, run_ms median vs C): Lean 119x, Wgsl 133x, Gleam 34x, Bend 34x, Python 22x (next4's lazy array import targets it), the compiled backends within 1-2.4x. Probe: lean --run on a program that only returns 0 takes as long as array_i16 with the full prelude (4.4 s each on the loaded box), so Lean's cost is toolchain startup and a Lean prelude-on-demand would not move run_ms.")
