inl note_of_kit_observe_timeout_bound_6 () = Note ("KIT-OBSERVE-TIMEOUT-BOUND", 6u32, "2026-10-31T23:58Z", "kit", "10-31 20:0x kit: CLOSED with evidence. The close condition (\"the next release's cargo tests\") could never fire: release trains no longer run cargo tests (phases are regen, crate gate, candidate, notebooks). Ran it directly instead on the node mirror kit-verify, under load (the TRAIN7 preview notebooks were running beside it): job-1793491061332-kit-node-observe-test2, cargo test --locked -p kit-process-observation --test windows -> \"stdout_consumer_timeout_closes_descendant_pipes ... ok\", finished in 4.28s, against the 20 s bound in kit_process_observation/tests/windows.rs:19. Remaining hand-written Rust tests like this one belong to EOIE-SPIRAL-TESTS (Spiral test blocks), not to a train phase.")
