inl note_of_fsharp_outside_compiler_26 () = Note ("FSHARP-OUTSIDE-COMPILER", 26u32, "2026-10-31T20:18Z", "main", "10-31 16:18 main: the last 7 rust-for-F# swaps (sm' 6, listm' 1; Rust passed within 1.5x) WAIT for tibia's 'landed' message (freeze extended past 16:30 at tibia's request: its env/listm'/file_system/sm' x-compat slices are proven and blocked only by compiler's live lib_gate on sm'). After tibia lands, rebuild the 7 swaps on the new bases with drop_test_target.ps1 (-Add rust, then drop fsharp), canonicalize, land.")
