inl note_of_x_sim_anydot_sweep_2 () = Note ("X-SIM-ANYDOT-SWEEP", 2u32, "2026-10-27T11:09Z", "x", "2026-10-27 07:09 x: sweep done in the tree (unstaged). Tests: xsim_test.exs:117 is now links-only (listm<ZWSP>.map, since .map is a gTLD; x.io plain). Fixtures: prelude.events.jsonl and the e2e worlds still carry the old any-dot bodies and get re-accepted by X-WIP-VERIFY's sim -Accept. Found and fixed a real gap: the sim restored only defused dots, but wire v3 also puts a ZWSP after @/#/$ sigils, so a text with a mention would not round-trip. world.spi body_text and inbox.spi rebuilt_parts now use defuse's restored_text (both :< defuse; the sim package already includes ../../client-), and Xsim.Frames.restored also drops the ZWSP after a sigil. Runs in the next X-WIP-VERIFY.")
