inl note_of_x_readme_wip_sync_2 () = Note ("X-README-WIP-SYNC", 2u32, "2026-10-27T11:14Z", "x", "2026-10-27 07:14 x: README prose synced (no tutorial code blocks touched). The post-thread paragraph states the links-only rule: known TLD, two-letter TLDs only after labels longer than two letters, x.io plain, listm.map defused, listm.foldBack plain, not after @, / or non-ASCII, t.co, and the sigil spaces. The thread paragraph names both removals. The module table gains tlds.spi and defuse.spi; splitter says posted_on. The crate table gains xc_requests, xc_posted, xc_domains, xc_weights and xc_chunks; xc_write and xc_frames say what they call.")
