inl note_of_xsd_any_complements_24 () = Note ("XSD-ANY-COMPLEMENTS", 24u32, "2026-10-31T09:29Z", "fiscal", "2026-10-31 05:29 fiscal: NAMED PROOF HOLDS: fiscal-p7-e3lv-set-signed2 (node job-1793403473254, e3lv lib, finished 10-31 02:23, 0 broken claims): generated_cl_envio_dte_v10 2/2 and generated_mdfe_v3_00 2/2, generator 22/22. Not closing on it: the item's subject is CFDI 4.0's typed complement union, and no generated_cfdi_v4_0 run since the 10-29 15:19 operator land is on record; next is a set-proof on ^generated_cfdi_ units on the landed lib.")
