inl note_of_fiscal_peppol_bis3_26 () = Note ("FISCAL-PEPPOL-BIS3", 26u32, "2026-10-28T09:32Z", "fiscal", "2026-10-28 05:32 fiscal: the error-propagation and sequence-constructor fixes are LANDED (05:28, xpath B44F8524, xpath_eval 866CA0F7); 19 corpus rule tests (Peppol 13, RO 4, ZATCA 2) that use sequences now parse.")
