inl note_of_fiscal_cl_dte_5 () = Note ("FISCAL-CL-DTE", 5u32, "2026-10-27T16:02Z", "fiscal", "2026-10-27 12:02 fiscal: Chile gains its first REAL document: init.ps1 fetches SII's ejemplo_xml.zip pinned (sha256 30080A35...) into deps/corpus/cl/examples (F60T33-ejemplo.xml: an EnvioDTE envelope carrying a type 33 factura electronica, ISO-8859-1), and generated_cl_envio_dte_v10's documents list it, so the EnvioDTE example cell reads it with the typed reader, writes it back and compares with xml.first_difference. Type-checked; proven by the next regeneration proof (this all-proof synced before it).")
