inl note_of_wipe_redo_ledger_17 () = Note ("WIPE-REDO-LEDGER", 17u32, "2026-10-29T12:38Z", "compiler", "10-29 08:5x compiler, batch 4 (closing redo rows from n4/n12):\nLOST OpenQasm tanh pack draft | WAS TEMP | SOURCE backlog:BACKEND-COVERAGE-GAPS n59 | STATE redo-done: apps/compiler/packs/apply-openqasm-tanh.ps1 (2 anchors, dry-run clean on live files; coverage = native_float_math_family added to the OpenQasm list at land) | ITEM BACKEND-COVERAGE-GAPS n60\nLOST Bend float pack draft | WAS TEMP | SOURCE backlog:BACKEND-COVERAGE-GAPS n59 | STATE redo-done: apps/compiler/packs/apply-bend-float-math.ps1 (1 anchor + regression sample native_float_math_f32 written with -Samples; Bend NaN self-compare probed not folded; the sample runs exit 0 on C, and the installed Bend rejects it) | ITEM BACKEND-COVERAGE-GAPS n60\nLOST P3 IVar applier | WAS TEMP | SOURCE node:C:\\home\\remote\\scripts | STATE recovered into apps/compiler/packs/apply-hopacsota-p3-ivar.ps1 (byte-exact core 6C960A7CCC717C79) | ITEM HOPACSOTA-P3\nLOST P3 shard + IVar wall-time results | WAS node jobs 1793189883882 (timed out on an oversubscribed node) / 1793187175380 (summary crash) | SOURCE redo with apps/compiler/packs/build-candidate.ps1 -Mode hopacsota (shard + IVar together: SPIRAL_HOPACSOTA_SHARDS=1 is IVar alone, =16 is both) + measure-arms.ps1 | STATE redo, queued for the heavy slot after TRAIN3 and the pack-6 install | ITEM HOPACSOTA-P3")
inl note_of_wipe_redo_ledger_18 () = Note ("WIPE-REDO-LEDGER", 18u32, "2026-10-29T12:43Z", "main", "10-29 08:5x main: safekeeping copy of tibia's node stages. All 86 node remote-stage\\lib-gate-* stage-root files (appliers, gate scripts and verdicts; 3,959 files, 108 MB; no lib.zip and no work\\ lib copies) were tarred on the node, copied and hash-verified (BD5E62BA..E584). They are extracted at C:\\home\\data\\rescue-2026-10-28\\tibia-lib-stages. Nothing applied; the re-apply stays with tibia (its session was idle at 08:4x; messages wait in its inbox).")
