inl note_of_wipe_redo_ledger_23 () = Note ("WIPE-REDO-LEDGER", 23u32, "2026-10-29T14:22Z", "fiscal", "2026-10-29 10:22 fiscal: PASS 1c, restating rows per main's sweep 1:\nLOST complements generator half | WAS scratchpad complements/src/generator.spi | SOURCE fiscal/lib-programs/generator-complements.kit (re-cut 09:38, tree 28099567 -> FF920D9F after set-cfdi2 caught a top-down scope bug) | STATE recovered-pending-proof (fiscal-set-cfdi3 job-1793281272369 running) | ITEM XSD-ANY-COMPLEMENTS\nLOST ubl_json_documents generator draft | WAS session scratchpad | SOURCE fiscal tree src/generator.spi (unstaged) | STATE recovered-pending-proof (fiscal-set-ublj job-1793275326126 running) | ITEM FISCAL-MY-MYINVOIS\nDURABILITY: today's land scripts (lander3.ps1, lib-guarded-do-supervisor.ps1), base-file undo copies and all draft folders copied from the scratchpad to C:\\home\\data\\fiscal-drafts\\land-1029 (47 files, sha256-equal); every land payload is also in fiscal/lib-programs/*.kit, and the lib files are clean at git HEAD before landing.")
