inl note_of_data_dir_home_12 () = Note ("DATA-DIR-HOME", 12u32, "2026-10-31T23:52Z", "fiscal", "2026-10-31 19:52 fiscal: FISCAL SHARE DONE. After tonight's Delphi + fidelity land (19:49), the last 2 folders (delphi, xml-fidelity: 60 files, the originals behind that land) were archived as 20261031-195205 (0 verify failures), and the then-empty C:\\\\home\\\\data\\\\fiscal-drafts was removed. Fiscal's lib land programs live in backlog notes, its gate roots in the session scratchpad, its undo copies in %LOCALAPPDATA%\\\\kit\\\\undo and %LOCALAPPDATA%\\\\fiscal-undo, its gate tooling in fiscal/scripts. Fiscal writes nothing under C:\\\\home\\\\data any more.")
inl note_of_data_dir_home_13 () = Note ("DATA-DIR-HOME", 13u32, "2026-11-01T04:46Z", "main", "main 00:4x C:\\home CENSUS besides git (user 11-01: 'these bunch of folders that got created in c home besides git to hold work that should be put in the repos instead'). tmp 168 GB (42 files: a split tmp.7z from 2023-08, the user's own archive; not lane work, untouched); recovery 20 GB / 714k files (wipe-20261028 restore results, resilience's; the partial/noise/conflicts parts are garbage by its own note); data 548 MB / 26k files (this item; fiscal's share drained); spiral-cache 171 MB (newest 10-31 20:27; owner unknown, compiler or kit build cache); ccmr-box, ccmr-alt, ccmr-land, ccmr-land-bin, g3a-bin-alt, g3a-bin-box 312 MB together, plus p2-cond3 61 MB (all 10-27/10-28, pre-wipe compiler experiment builds, CCMR and G3A by name); remote-queue 0.1 MB (node upkeep log, main's); alias 2023 (user's). Loose files at the C:\\home root: ccmr-land-build.log, ccmr-land-runA/B.log (411 KB each), g3a-alt.log, g3a-box.log. Next: compiler confirms ccmr/g3a/p2-cond3 and spiral-cache are dead experiment outputs, then archive them (archive-never-delete; build outputs may be freed). Resilience's census in round 2 adds owners.")
inl note_of_data_dir_home_14 () = Note ("DATA-DIR-HOME", 14u32, "2026-11-01T06:53Z", "x", "2026-11-01 02:53 x: x share re-checked at the round-3 groom: C:\\home\\data holds no x folder or file (no entry named x-*, xsim*, xqueue*). The archives from 10-31 (060539, 061426, 082550, 093648, 093702, 164531) carry the moved drafts, with restore rules on X-HAND-UNITS n29/n33. x is done here; the item stays open for the other lanes.")
