inl note_of_data_dir_home_17 () = Note ("DATA-DIR-HOME", 17u32, "2026-11-01T14:35Z", "main", "main 10:3x (user 11-01: 'another scan of files left out in tmp, home, lab, etc. and move them to their proper place even if incomplete, ci doesn't need to be passing all the time'). Rule from the user: drafts go to their proper repo place even incomplete, since CI failing is information and gh-pages only publishes when the build passes. Scan targets: C:\\home\\* besides git (00:4x census), %TEMP%\\* lane scratch older than a day, any lab/ in any repo, untracked files in repos (e.g. the fork's posts/, spiral apps/compiler/packs/). Each found file gets a destination or an archive+drop decision.")
