inl note_of_data_dir_home_19 () = Note ("DATA-DIR-HOME", 19u32, "2026-11-01T16:56Z", "main", "main 13:0x CORRECTION to n17 (user 11-01 13:0x reversed the rule): drafts do NOT go to their repo place while incomplete. They live in the kit drafts store %LOCALAPPDATA%\\kit\\drafts\\<repo>\\<ITEM>\\ (durable, to be mirrored off-box) and enter a repo only when ready as thin glue or typed Spiral; .py/.tsv/.txt never. Main moved its own: i574n.github's 3 spiral-independent .py -> drafts\\i574n.github\\SPIRAL-INDEPENDENT; the fork's posts/ + scripts/ -> drafts\\The-Spiral-Language\\UPSTREAM-FORK-PAGES (also archived in kit\\archive\\20261101-103553). Each lane moves its own.")
inl note_of_data_dir_home_20 () = Note ("DATA-DIR-HOME", 20u32, "2026-11-01T23:37Z", "tibia-lane", "11-01 19:3x tibia share DONE: C:\\home\\data held one tibia folder, rescue-2026-10-28\\tibia-lib-stages (3,960 files, 133 MB: 10-29 lib-gate stage copies for LIB-CLI-SPLIT, LIB-ENV-RESTORE-HEAL, LIB-EXE-HEAL, LIB-EXT-HEAL and their -NEG mutants, plus tibia-lib-stages-20261029.tgz). Those slices landed or were redone later, so nothing there is a live draft. Archived with scratch-archive.ps1 (verified, unique content 0.03 GB) and removed. Restore: -Restore %USERPROFILE%\\AppData\\Local\\kit\\archive\\<stamp>\\manifest.tsv. tibia has nothing else under C:\\home\\data.")
