inl note_of_fiscal_granular_280_1 () = Note ("FISCAL-GRANULAR-280", 1u32, "2026-11-01T04:39Z", "fiscal", "2026-11-01 02:10 fiscal: MEASURED (body characters after the header line, Latin weight 1): 169 top-level definitions in src/*.spi, 83 over 280. Biggest five with their split plan: (1) corpus_checks.spi:227 test regional_rules_census 6,112 -> one census helper plus one test per region (UBL-TR, ZATCA, RO, DIAN, PEPPOL), each pinning only its own row; (2) generator.spi:750 family_bench 3,553 -> emit_bench_header / emit_bench_timing / emit_bench_write pieces joined by one 1-line def; (3) generator.spi:620 json_round_trip 3,424 -> emit_json_read, emit_json_write, emit_json_compare; (4) corpus_checks.spi:700 dian_samples_keep_their_compiled_rule_findings 3,109 -> the 44-row expected table as its own data definition (dian_expected_findings), split by toolkit folder (Ejemplificaciones vs Eventos RADIAN), and a short check; (5) corpus_checks.spi:606 zatca_samples_pass_the_zatca_rules 2,352 -> rule loading, findings collection and the assertion as three defs. Do AFTER the edition-3 respell lands (it rewrites every line), one file per change, with a full src gate each.")
