inl note_of_fiscal_granular_280_43 () = Note ("FISCAL-GRANULAR-280", 43u32, "2026-11-05T09:43Z", "fiscal", "IDENTITY REGENS QUEUED on the node, 11-05 05:5x local: job-1793871773349-fiscal-identity runs after job-1793868130086 (nfe_v4) with a 7200000 ms cap counted from its own start (kept independent of nfe_v4's 3 h cell per widen-queued-job-amend-timeout). Script C:\\home\\remote-stage\\node-identity.ps1 176DAFF6, inputs in fiscal-identity-in, hash-verified on the node. Four arms, each in its own tree (core from VS Code Plugin\\core, a lib copy with xml B6EED09B + xml_codec 5694B36A + the arm's xsd_emit, fiscal src from the box, the corpus as a read-only junction; junctions removed as links before any recursive delete, and corpus file count plus mirror xsd_emit hash checked start vs end). (1) facet 4E831159 + .next6 vs sentinel D00BE390 + .next7, the certificates sentinel identity, after two europa VOIDs; (2) toml base 2A9BE918 + families F1CF3DDF vs FISCAL-GRANULAR-280 generator 40DE71DF + families 99A8339B, the repo_path / row-split / documents-as-data identity. Each arm compiles the generator plus the harness main, rustc -O, runs, and hashes every generated file. PENDING.")
