inl note_of_fiscal_granular_280_54 () = Note ("FISCAL-GRANULAR-280", 54u32, "2026-11-06T13:33Z", "fiscal", "09:3x LAST CODE OVERAGE DRAFTED: whole-src count on europa (live fiscal/src, 101 findings) = 3 code overages: families 248 (575), families 484 (471), document 78 canon_record (374); the rest are test blocks. Draft v3 document.spi 5AA0119C (base 667309A1): amount_sum, header_terms alias, header_values (5 strings -> 5 typed term_values), canon_from_values (destructured typed header, 8 short field lines), canon_record keeps its signature and chains them. Count: 0 code overages (3 findings, all test blocks from 126). Box --check on a full live-src copy + both drafts: document, families, generator, posting, canon_derived all exit 0. With families ACA8B5B5 that makes fiscal/src 0 CODE OVERAGES = this item's DoD. PROOFS QUEUED on the node: job-1793968119108 (families regen identity) and job-1793971916580-fiscal-docgate (document, posting, canon_derived Cells on a fresh stage with the document draft). Land both on green.")
inl note_of_fiscal_granular_280_55 () = Note ("FISCAL-GRANULAR-280", 55u32, "2026-11-06T15:30Z", "fiscal", "11:3x FAMILIES LANDED in fiscal src, in place and unstaged: src/families.spi 684AAFF5 -> 6FEB454F (backup families.before-granular3-684AAFF5.spi in the session scratchpad). PROOF: node job-1793968119108-fiscal-granular3-identity (core 24D39673): live 684AAFF5 vs draft ACA8B5B5, each a whole-family regen (compile 0, rustc 0, run 45 = family count), 166 files each, 0 DIFFERING, corpus 1290 unchanged. The landed text is ACA8B5B5 after the formatter (format reflowed ONE record-update line into a 4-line block, nothing else; diffed); on the formatted text: format --check 0, europa GRANULAR 0 code overages, box --check families 0 + generator 0 (pin a688). Left for DoD: document.spi (draft 5AA0119C, Cells proof queued as the docgate job).")
inl note_of_fiscal_granular_280_56 () = Note ("FISCAL-GRANULAR-280", 56u32, "2026-11-06T15:37Z", "fiscal", "11:3x document draft now DFE711A4 = 5AA0119C after the formatter (pin a688), which only reflowed three long headers (amount_sum, header_values, canon_from_values) onto multiple lines; diffed. On DFE711A4: format --check 0, europa GRANULAR 0 code overages, box --check document / posting / canon_derived 0. The docgate job (job-1793971916580, running) proves 5AA0119C, the pre-format bytes; land DFE711A4 on its green, as done for families. Compiler's notice (pack55d FORMATTER-JOIN-LONE-THEN): the new formatter joins lone then/?> lines and CI formats with the committed compiler, so no repo-wide reformat until the user pushes that core; today's two format runs used pin a688 and changed only long-line reflows.")
