inl note_of_granular_split_xsd_emit_22 () = Note ("GRANULAR-SPLIT-XSD-EMIT", 22u32, "2026-11-04T16:47Z", "fiscal", "2026-11-04 12:47 fiscal: draft dir pruned to the land pair: drafts spiral\\GRANULAR-SPLIT-XSD-EMIT\\lib\\spiral\\xsd_emit.spi = AB4B0165 (every proven step + the cell-cap header) and xsd_emit.base-5B274B48.spi (the decode draft it lands on). 23 intermediate step files removed (each proven and contained in the final). Land: lib_land_window -Draft 'xsd_emit.spi=<that path>' -BaseHash 5B274B48, right after the joint decode land.")
