inl note_of_fiscal_lib_granular_3_schematron_2 () = Note ("FISCAL-LIB-GRANULAR-3-SCHEMATRON", 2u32, "2026-11-06T15:45Z", "fiscal", "11:5x DRAFT schematron.spi F47F276E (base 73AC350287D8; kit drafts spiral FISCAL-LIB-GRANULAR-3-SCHEMATRON\\v1), produced by a fiscal subagent and VERIFIED independently by fiscal: europa GRANULAR code overages 17 -> 0; test section byte-identical to live (so the module's own tests judge the new code); LF; round trip PASSED (73 s); box --check schematron 0 + schematron_run 0 (the agent also showed --check rejects an injected type error). 34 new helpers, all schematron_-prefixed and unused elsewhere in lib. Review notes: the filter loops (assertions_in, rules_in, patterns_in, message_text, compiled_assertions, compiled_rule_groups) now match node :: rest and call a per-node helper instead of a guarded arm; local closures after / pattern_of became top-level (pattern_of partially applied). Counter rule learned: the longest-arm discount applies only when the match IS the body, with every arm line <= 120 chars and no nested ?= or ?>. Cells gate QUEUED: node job-1793979884642-fiscal-libgran3-gate. TYPEFEATURES: none new.")
