inl note_of_fiscal_lib_granular_4_xsd_2 () = Note ("FISCAL-LIB-GRANULAR-4-XSD", 2u32, "2026-11-06T16:05Z", "fiscal", "12:0x DRAFTS (kit drafts spiral FISCAL-LIB-GRANULAR-4-XSD\\v1, by a fiscal subagent, VERIFIED by fiscal): xml EE1DC7C7 4 -> 0, xsd F057AC1A 13 -> 0, xsd_resolve 90E39230 3 -> 0 code overages (europa counter); test sections byte-identical to live; LF; round trip of the three PASSED; agent --check of xml/xsd/xsd_resolve + consumers xsd_emit/schematron 0. 56 new helpers with xml_/xsd_/resolve_ prefixes, checked unused in lib and fiscal/generated. Review notes: in xsd.canonical the Complex/Derived/Element/Attribute arms now build the record from all payload fields (values identical) instead of { x ?| ... }; canonical_schema and merge update a bound record. PROOFS QUEUED on the node: job-1793980948603-fiscal-libgran4-gate (Cells: xml, xsd, xsd_resolve) and job-1793981107602-fiscal-identity3 (whole-family regen: lib4 drafts vs live must be byte-identical). TYPEFEATURES: none new.")
