inl note_of_tibia_pr30_run_3 () = Note ("TIBIA-PR30-RUN", 3u32, "2026-11-06T21:26Z", "tibia", "11-06 17:2x tibia: PR-30 RESULT written in tibia/docs/BENCHMARK.md (unstaged). Node job-1793993684886-tibia-pr30-run (tree EF7486F7554A, C, 375 s, log read in full): cfr worth -1,000,600,000, 126 deaths, 0 clears of 100; cfr_argmax -1,000,600,000, 127 deaths, 0 clears; retreat2 -150,600, 38 deaths, 100 clears. Prediction HOLDS (A far below B): the CFR brain never clears, consistent with the abstraction paying Melee nothing. Decision as pre-registered: the CFR table stays a non-NN baseline; TIBIA-NUGGET-TABULAR-CFR closes on this verdict; the next game version is TIBIA-CFR-KILL-VALUE-CODE (now unblocked by this run).")
