inl note_of_auto_export_3_multi_module_4 () = Note ("AUTO-EXPORT-3-MULTI-MODULE", 4u32, "2026-11-06T22:40Z", "compiler", "11-06 18:4x compiler: pack59 (core 4248CDFC6D5076DC) PASSES every gate: linked 18/18 (incl. the new 2-module sample), smoke 159 at parity / DISAGREE 0, lib type probe PASS on sized_array, pickler and rust (the modules that use type arithmetic or sized), and its Rust outputs of all 1204 sample inputs are byte-identical to pack58b's (550/550, no status change; pack58b vs pack57 = the 2 intended RUST-ARRAY-2 loop rewrites). Ready to install as one pack (pack58b's 3 programs + this) after kit's train on the node ends (TRAIN35 was replaced by TRAIN36, pinned pack57).")
